# Golden cases whose .out is hand-corrected because mawk (the reference awk
# used by scripts/regen_golden.py) is the outlier: onetrue-awk and
# gawk --posix agree with each other and with the .out file.
# regen_golden.py never rewrites these; see DESIGN.md.
# Format: CATEGORY/NAME  reason
builtins/undefined_escapes  mawk keeps the backslash of undefined escapes like "\&", "\q", "\." (onetrue-awk and gawk drop it)
functions/extra_args  mawk rejects a call with more arguments than the function has parameters (fatal); onetrue-awk and gawk warn on stderr and run it
builtins/substr_clamp  mawk shortens the length when the start is below 1 (substr("hello", -1, 3) is "hell"); onetrue-awk and gawk clamp the start to 1 ("hel")
io/pipe_getline_concat  mawk parses "echo " "hi" | getline as "echo " ("hi" | getline); onetrue-awk and gawk run the command "echo hi"
